#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "O kò ní àṣẹ fún ẹ̀rọ ti kúlọ́sítà yẹn."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Orúkọ: kúlọ́sítà mìíràn ti ń lo orúkọ yìí tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "A kò fi kúlọ́sítà náà pamọ́: ẹnì kan mìíràn ti yí i padà láti ìgbà tí a ti ṣí fọ́ọ̀mù náà, tàbí kíkọ rẹ̀ kùnà. Tún ṣí i kí o sì tún àtúnṣe náà ṣe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "A ti fi kúlọ́sítà náà pamọ́."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "A kò yí ipò kúlọ́sítà náà padà: kíkọ rẹ̀ kùnà. Wo àkọsílẹ̀ ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "A ti pa kúlọ́sítà náà àti àwòrán àkókò tí a fi pamọ́ rẹ̀ rẹ́. A pa ẹ̀rọ àti àwọn àwòrán ìṣirò rẹ̀ mọ́. A kò kàn sí olùṣètò àkókò náà."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "A ti ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ náà àti àwọn àwòrán ìṣirò rẹ̀."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "A kò ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ náà: kúlọ́sítà náà ti ní ẹ̀rọ kan tẹ́lẹ̀, ẹnì kan mìíràn ti yí i padà láti ìgbà tí a ti ṣí ojú-ewé náà, tàbí Cacti kọ̀ ọ́. Wo àkọsílẹ̀ ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "A ti so kúlọ́sítà náà pọ̀ mọ́ ẹ̀rọ náà."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "A kò so kúlọ́sítà náà pọ̀: ẹ̀rọ náà kò sí, a kò gbà á láàyè fún ọ, ó ti gbé kúlọ́sítà mìíràn tẹ́lẹ̀, tàbí ẹnì kan mìíràn ti yí kúlọ́sítà náà padà láti ìgbà tí a ti ṣí ojú-ewé náà."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "A ti fi àwọn àwòrán ìṣirò tí ó sọnù kún un."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "A kò fi àwòrán ìṣirò kankan kún un: kúlọ́sítà náà kò ní ẹ̀rọ, tàbí ẹ̀rọ rẹ̀ kò sí mọ́."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "A kò yọ ìsopọ̀ kúlọ́sítà náà kúrò: ẹnì kan mìíràn ti yí i padà láti ìgbà tí a ti ṣí ojú-ewé náà."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "A ti yọ ìsopọ̀ kúlọ́sítà náà kúrò. A pa ẹ̀rọ náà àti àwọn àwòrán ìṣirò rẹ̀ mọ́."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "A ti tún àwọn ìpín kọ sínú àtọ́ka láti inú àwòrán àkókò náà."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "A kò tún àwọn ìpín kọ sínú àtọ́ka: ẹ̀rọ náà wà ní àìṣiṣẹ́ tàbí kò ṣeé dé bá, nítorí náà Cacti fo ìbéèrè dátà rẹ̀ kọjá."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "A kò tún àwọn ìpín kọ sínú àtọ́ka: Cacti kò lè ṣiṣẹ́ ìbéèrè dátà náà. Wo àkọsílẹ̀ ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "A kò tún àwọn ìpín kọ sínú àtọ́ka: a kò fi ìbéèrè dátà HPC Scheduler sórí ẹ̀rọ. Fi àwọn àwòkọ náà sórí ẹ̀rọ láti ojú-ewé ìlera."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "A kò tún àwọn ìpín kọ sínú àtọ́ka: kúlọ́sítà náà kò ní ẹ̀rọ, tàbí ẹ̀rọ rẹ̀ kò sí mọ́."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "A ti fi àwọn àwòkọ HPC Scheduler sórí ẹ̀rọ."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "A kò fi àwọn àwòkọ náà sórí ẹ̀rọ: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Ìwòran àbójútó"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "A kò le ka àwọn àkíyèsí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alákòóso láti ṣàyẹ̀wò àkọsílẹ̀ àfikún náà."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ẹgbẹ́ ìdí ìdádúró àti ìtuntun àwòrán àkókò lórí àkópọ̀. Gbé àwọn ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀, ìsopọ̀ kúlọ́sítà àti ìlànà ìtọ́jú sókè sí alákòóso."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Orúkọ: lo lẹ́tà, nọ́ńbà, àmì ìdádúró, ìlà àárín, tàbí ìlà ìsàlẹ̀ 1 sí 64, kí ó sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà tàbí nọ́ńbà."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn poller tí a tò sílẹ̀."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Àkókò Àárín Ìkójọpọ̀: tẹ odidi ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láti %d sí %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Ìfiránṣẹ́: yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ọ̀nà ìfiránṣẹ́ tí a tò sílẹ̀."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: tẹ ipa-ọ̀nà pípé sílẹ̀, tàbí fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti lo ìlànà àkọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀ olùkójọ."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: olùgbàlejò àti ibùdó yìí kò sí lórí àtòjọ olùgbàlejò slurmrestd ní Settings."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: tẹ https:// URL kan láìsí orúkọ olùmúlò, ìbéèrè, tàbí ìpín; http:// lásán ni a gbà nìkan fún àdírẹ́sì loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Olùmúlò slurmrestd: lo lẹ́tà, nọ́ńbà, àmì ìdádúró, ìlà àárín, tàbí ìlà ìsàlẹ̀ tí kò ju 64 lọ, tàbí fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún àmì ìdánimọ̀ olùmúlò."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Fáìlì Àmì Ìdánimọ̀: tẹ ipa-ọ̀nà pípé ti fáìlì àmì ìdánimọ̀ lórí olùkójọ. A kì í tẹ àmì ìdánimọ̀ náà fúnra rẹ̀ síbí rárá."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Fáìlì Àmì Ìdánimọ̀: kò sí àwọn àkójọpọ̀ fáìlì àmì ìdánimọ̀ tí a ti ṣètò sílẹ̀ síbẹ̀. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alákòóso Cacti láti ṣètò wọn lábẹ́ Settings, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Fáìlì Àmì Ìdánimọ̀: fáìlì náà gbọ́dọ̀ wà nínú ọ̀kan lára àwọn àkójọpọ̀ fáìlì àmì ìdánimọ̀ tí a ṣètò ní Settings (%s)."

