#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Olùtúpalẹ̀ dátà Slurm fún àwọn àṣẹ oníbàárà. Yan èyí tí ìtẹ̀jáde ìṣùpọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan tí a kà nípasẹ̀ àwọn àṣẹ oníbàárà ní: v0.0.43 wà nínú 25.05, 25.11, àti 26.05 a sì yọ ọ́ kúrò ní 27.05; v0.0.44 nílò 25.11 tàbí èyí tí ó tẹ̀lé e; v0.0.45 nílò 26.05 tàbí èyí tí ó tẹ̀lé e. Ojú-ewé ìlera ń kìlọ̀ nígbà tí ìṣùpọ̀ bá ròyìn ìtẹ̀jáde láìsí rẹ̀. Àwọn ìṣùpọ̀ tí a kà nípasẹ̀ slurmrestd máa ń fo ètò yìí dà: wọ́n ń lo èyí tí ó tuntun jùlọ nínú àwọn wọ̀nyí tí daemon ń pèsè, ojú-ewé ìlera sì ń fi èyí hàn."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà pípé sí squeue lórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò kọ̀ọ̀kan tí ń ka ìṣùpọ̀ nípasẹ̀ àwọn àṣẹ oníbàárà. Àfikún náà ń ṣiṣẹ́ rẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí squeue --all --json nìkan pẹ̀lú olùtúpalẹ̀ dátà lókè."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà pípé sí scontrol. Àfikún náà ń ṣiṣẹ́ scontrol --json show node, show partition, àti show reservation nìkan; kì í ṣe update, reconfigure, tàbí token láé."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà pípé sí sshare, tí a lò fún àwọn ìṣùpọ̀ tí ń gba ìpín-dọ́gba nìkan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Àwọn Òpin"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìdádúró Ìpè"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ìpè olùṣètò kan lè gbà kí a tó dá a dúró kí a sì kọ abala rẹ̀ sílẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí ó kùnà. Ìpè kì í kọjá ètò àkókò olùkà náà pẹ̀lú."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Ìdáhùn Púpọ̀ Jùlọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "MiB tí ìpè olùṣètò kan lè dá padà. Ìdáhùn tí ó tóbi jù ni a máa ń kọ̀ sílẹ̀ tí a sì ń kọ abala rẹ̀ sílẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí ó kùnà. Ìtúmọ̀ nílò ní nǹkan bí ìlọ́po 12 ìwọ̀n ìdáhùn, nítorí náà olùkà ń lo ó pọ̀ jù (Ìrántí Ìkójọpọ̀ - 64) / 12 MiB, ojú-ewé ìlera sì ń kìlọ̀ nígbà tí iye yìí bá tóbi jù."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Ìrántí Ìkójọpọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "MiB ti ìrántí PHP tí ìṣiṣẹ́ ìkójọpọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan ń gbé òpin rẹ̀ sókè sí (kì í dín òpin kù láé). Àṣàyàn ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ti 1024 bá àwọn ìdáhùn tí ó tó 80 MiB mu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà pípé sí prlimit (util-linux), tí a lò láti ṣe òpin ààyè àdírẹ́sì ti àṣẹ oníbàárà kọ̀ọ̀kan. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti ṣiṣẹ́ àwọn àṣẹ láìsí òpin ìrántí; ojú-ewé ìlera yóò wá kìlọ̀."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Òpin Ìrántí Àṣẹ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "MiB ti ààyè àdírẹ́sì tí àṣẹ oníbàárà kọ̀ọ̀kan lè lò, nípasẹ̀ prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìwé-ẹ̀rí slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Àwọn Fóldà Fáìlì Àmì-ìdánimọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Àwọn fóldà pípé lórí àwọn olùṣàyẹ̀wò tí ó lè gba àwọn fáìlì àmì-ìdánimọ̀ slurmrestd, tí a yà sọ́tọ̀ pẹ̀lú kọ́mà tàbí ààyè. Ìṣùpọ̀ kan lè dárúkọ fáìlì àmì-ìdánimọ̀ kan nìkan nínú ọ̀kan lára wọn, tí olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò ni, tí a sì dé láìsí ìjápọ̀ àpẹẹrẹ. Jẹ́ kí fóldà kọ̀ọ̀kan ṣe é kọ sí nìkan láti ọwọ́ root àti olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò. Òfo túmọ̀ sí pé kò sí ìṣùpọ̀ tí ó lè lo slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "Àwọn Olùgbàlejò slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Kò pọndandan. Àwọn olùgbàlejò slurmrestd tí ìṣùpọ̀ lè dárúkọ, gẹ́gẹ́ bí host tàbí host:port, tí a yà sọ́tọ̀ pẹ̀lú kọ́mà tàbí ààyè. Àkọsílẹ̀ láìsí ibùdó gba ibùdó èyíkéyìí láàyè lórí olùgbàlejò náà. Òfo gba olùgbàlejò èyíkéyìí láàyè."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá ṣáájú kí àmì-ìdánimọ̀ tó parí nígbà tí ojú-ewé ìlera bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í kìlọ̀, tí àmì-ìdánimọ̀ bá ní àkókò ìparí."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Ìkìlọ̀ Ìparí Àmì-ìdánimọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Yọ kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Pa Àwọn Tábìlì Àfikún Mọ́ Nígbà Yíyọ Kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá fi àmì sí i, yíyọ àfikún náà kúrò yóò pa àwọn ìṣùpọ̀ àti àwọn àwòrán-ipò rẹ̀ mọ́. Pa á rẹ́ kí yíyọ kúrò lè pa wọ́n rẹ́; kó àwọn ìṣùpọ̀ náà jáde kọ́kọ́ láti HPC Clusters. Àfikún náà kò dá àwọn ẹ̀rọ Cacti tàbí àwọn ìṣètò Maint kankan sílẹ̀ nínú ìtẹ̀jáde yìí, a kò sì kan sí olùṣètò náà lọ́nàkọnà."

#: lib/TemplateInstaller.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query file %s is not installed in Cacti's resource/script_server directory."
msgstr "A kò fi fáìlì ìbéèrè dátà %s sínú fóldà resource/script_server ti Cacti."

#: lib/TemplateInstaller.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query file %s in Cacti's resource/script_server directory differs from the one the plugin ships."
msgstr "Fáìlì ìbéèrè dátà %s nínú fóldà resource/script_server ti Cacti yàtọ̀ sí èyí tí àfikún náà mú wá."

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "readable only by the poller user"
msgstr "tí olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò nìkan lè kà"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "readable by the file group; restrict it to the poller user (chmod 600)"
msgstr "tí ẹgbẹ́ fáìlì lè kà; dín in kù sí olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò nìkan (chmod 600)"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "readable by every user on the poller; restrict it to the poller user (chmod 600)"
msgstr "tí gbogbo olùlò lórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò lè kà; dín in kù sí olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò nìkan (chmod 600)"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "refused: owned by a user other than the poller user (chown it to the poller user)"
msgstr "a kọ̀ ọ́: olùlò mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò ni ó ni ín (ṣe chown rẹ̀ sí olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò)"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "missing or not readable by the poller user"
msgstr "kò sí tàbí olùlò olùṣàyẹ̀wò kò lè kà á"

#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "refused: outside the token file directories set in Settings, reached through a symbolic link, not a regular file, writable by others, or too large; the log names the reason"
msgstr "a kọ̀ ọ́: ó wà lóde àwọn fóldà fáìlì àmì-ìdánimọ̀ tí a ṣètò nínú Ètò, a dé e nípasẹ̀ ìjápọ̀ àpẹẹrẹ, kì í ṣe fáìlì déédéé, ó ṣe é kọ sí láti ọwọ́ àwọn mìíràn, tàbí ó tóbi jù; àkọsílẹ̀ náà dárúkọ ìdí rẹ̀"

#: lib/TokenState.php
